{"root_text": {"uid": "ja67", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "උච්ඡංග ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "At Sāketa ", "uid": "ja68"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Queen Gentle-heart ", "uid": "ja66"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja67' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>7. ඉත්ථි වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>67. උච්ඡංග ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv67' href='#msdiv67'>Msdiv 67</a>“දෙවයන් වහන්ස, පුත්‍ර තෙමේ මාගේ ඇකයෙහිමය. ස්වාමිතෙමේ හුදකලාව මඟ යන්නාවූ මට සුලභය. යම් දෙශයකින් සහෝදරයකු ගෙණ එම්ද, ඒ මාතෘකුක්ෂි නම් දෙශය නොදක්නෙමි”යි (එහෙයින් මාගේ සහෝදරයා දෙවයි ඉල්වූ.)</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>උච්ඡඞ්ගජාතකං සත්තමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "translation": {"uid": "ja67", "lang": "si", "is_root": false, "title": "උච්ඡංග ජාතකය", "author": "A.P. de Zoysa", "author_short": "Zoysa", "author_uid": "zoysa", "next": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "At Sāketa ", "uid": "ja68"}, "previous": {"author_uid": "zoysa", "lang": "si", "name": "Queen Gentle-heart ", "uid": "ja66"}, "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset='UTF-8'>\n<meta name='author' content='A.P. de Zoysa'>\n<title></title>\n</head>\n<body>\n<article id='ja67' lang='si'>\n<header>\n<ul>\n<li class='division'>ඛුද්දකනිකාය</li>\n<li class='subdivision'>ජාතක</li>\n<li>(පඨමො භාගො)</li>\n<li>1. එකක නිපාතය</li>\n<li class='vagga'>7. ඉත්ථි වර්ගය</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>67. උච්ඡංග ජාතකය</h1>\n</header>\n<p><a class='ref msdiv' id='msdiv67' href='#msdiv67'>Msdiv 67</a>“දෙවයන් වහන්ස, පුත්‍ර තෙමේ මාගේ ඇකයෙහිමය. ස්වාමිතෙමේ හුදකලාව මඟ යන්නාවූ මට සුලභය. යම් දෙශයකින් සහෝදරයකු ගෙණ එම්ද, ඒ මාතෘකුක්ෂි නම් දෙශය නොදක්නෙමි”යි (එහෙයින් මාගේ සහෝදරයා දෙවයි ඉල්වූ.)</p>\n<p class='endsutta'>උච්ඡඞ්ගජාතකං සත්තමං.</p>\n<footer>\n<p><span class='author'>AP de Zoysa</span> edition.</p>\n<p>Permission to publish was kindly granted by Kumari Jayawardhana.</p>\n<p>Digital files were kindly supplied by Sirisumana Godage of <a href='http://www.godage.com/'>Godage International Publishing</a>, who publish a print edition of this text.</p>\n<p>Conversion from PDF was by Janaka of <a href='http://pitaka.lk/'>http://pitaka.lk/</a>.</p>\n<p>The assistance of Amaradasa Liyanagamage, Ven Mettavihari and Maithri Panagoda is gratefully acknowledged.</p>\n<p>Prepared for SuttaCentral by <span class='editor'>Ayya Kathrin Vimalañāṇī</span>.</p>\n</footer>\n</article>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, "segmented": false, "suttaplex": {"acronym": "Ja 67", "alt_acronym": null, "volpages": "PTS 1.308", "alt_volpages": null, "uid": "ja67", "blurb": "“A son’s an easy find.”—This story was told by the Master while at Jetavana, about a certain country-woman.", "difficulty": null, "original_title": "Ucchaṅgajātaka", "root_lang": "pli", "root_lang_name": "Pāli", "type": "leaf", "from": null, "translated_title": "උච්ඡංග ජාතකය", "translations": [{"lang": "de", "lang_name": "Deutsch", "is_root": false, "author": "Sabbamitta", "author_short": "sabbamitta", "author_uid": "sabbamitta", "publi